{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 1945652653051365353,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Finding Power of Factorial Divisor",
      "source_hash": 814537503453086547,
      "context_hash": 1868409996785990874,
      "translation": "팩토리얼 약수의 거듭제곱 구하기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:01:53.425836Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "You are given two numbers $n$ and $k$.",
      "source_hash": 179828413723885776,
      "context_hash": 10429956227759015224,
      "translation": "두 수 $n$과 $k$가 주어집니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:01:53.425836Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Find the largest integer $x$ such that $k^x$ divides $n!$.",
      "source_hash": 3795403883924375930,
      "context_hash": 1050970339113677839,
      "translation": "$k^x$가 $n!$을 나누는 가장 큰 정수 $x$를 구하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:01:53.425837Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Prime $k$",
      "source_hash": 15436500987769194550,
      "context_hash": 15802229614437807151,
      "translation": "소수 $k$",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:01:53.425837Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Prime k",
      "source_hash": 12316452264584157657,
      "context_hash": 14473020807303265211,
      "translation": "소수 k",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:01:53.425837Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Let's first consider the case of prime $k$.",
      "source_hash": 15734463350779044386,
      "context_hash": 64427042799729882,
      "translation": "먼저 $k$가 소수인 경우를 살펴봅시다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:01:53.425837Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "The explicit expression for factorial",
      "source_hash": 14928242402092591071,
      "context_hash": 6456586544799025966,
      "translation": "팩토리얼을 명시적으로 풀어 쓴 식은 다음과 같습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:01:53.425837Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Note that every $k$-th element of the product is divisible by $k$, i.e. adds $+1$ to the answer; the number of such elements is $\\Bigl\\lfloor\\dfrac{n}{k}\\Bigr\\rfloor$.",
      "source_hash": 10880021294755285104,
      "context_hash": 6486857393149545088,
      "translation": "곱에서 $k$번째 원소마다 $k$로 나누어떨어지므로 답에 $+1$을 더한다는 점에 주목하십시오. 이러한 원소의 개수는 $\\Bigl\\lfloor\\dfrac{n}{k}\\Bigr\\rfloor$입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:01:53.425838Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "Next, every $k^2$-th element is divisible by $k^2$, i.e. adds another $+1$ to the answer (the first power of $k$ has already been counted in the previous paragraph).",
      "source_hash": 15557378588920576144,
      "context_hash": 6623025565252675419,
      "translation": "다음으로, $k^2$번째 원소마다 $k^2$로 나누어떨어지므로 답에 $+1$을 한 번 더 더합니다($k$의 첫 번째 거듭제곱은 앞 문단에서 이미 세었습니다).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:01:53.425838Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:5/seg:1",
      "source": "The number of such elements is $\\Bigl\\lfloor\\dfrac{n}{k^2}\\Bigr\\rfloor$.",
      "source_hash": 11915476892247504054,
      "context_hash": 11663992155584628831,
      "translation": "이러한 원소의 개수는 $\\Bigl\\lfloor\\dfrac{n}{k^2}\\Bigr\\rfloor$입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:01:53.425838Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "And so on, for every $i$ each $k^i$-th element adds another $+1$ to the answer, and there are $\\Bigl\\lfloor\\dfrac{n}{k^i}\\Bigr\\rfloor$ such elements.",
      "source_hash": 13745866255803688727,
      "context_hash": 2266736141046271839,
      "translation": "이와 같은 방식으로, 모든 $i$에 대해 $k^i$번째 원소마다 답에 $+1$을 한 번 더 더하며, 이러한 원소는 $\\Bigl\\lfloor\\dfrac{n}{k^i}\\Bigr\\rfloor$개입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:01:53.425838Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "The final answer is",
      "source_hash": 12629925168657546274,
      "context_hash": 4864795168160936833,
      "translation": "최종 답은 다음과 같습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:01:53.425838Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "This result is also known as [Legendre's formula](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Legendre%27s_formula).",
      "source_hash": 9368969977243763724,
      "context_hash": 17328606744445725116,
      "translation": "이 결과는 [르장드르 공식](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Legendre%27s_formula)으로도 알려져 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:01:53.425838Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:9/seg:1",
      "source": "The sum is of course finite, since only approximately the first $\\log_k n$ elements are not zeros.",
      "source_hash": 8539460321671501866,
      "context_hash": 17931895201231086797,
      "translation": "대략 처음 $\\log_k n$개의 원소만 0이 아니므로 이 합은 당연히 유한합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:01:53.425838Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:9/seg:2",
      "source": "Thus, the runtime of this algorithm is $O(\\log_k n)$.",
      "source_hash": 4537998845541176322,
      "context_hash": 8213895467871592415,
      "translation": "따라서 이 알고리즘의 실행 시간은 $O(\\log_k n)$입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:01:53.425839Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:10/seg:0",
      "source": "Implementation",
      "source_hash": 14188291987651099077,
      "context_hash": 14604176888573050400,
      "translation": "구현",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:01:53.425839Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Composite $k$",
      "source_hash": 6617204025341008180,
      "context_hash": 11673830255003233,
      "translation": "합성수 $k$",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:01:53.425839Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Composite k",
      "source_hash": 13792464084230047909,
      "context_hash": 16152940448818762490,
      "translation": "합성수 k",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:01:53.425839Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "The same idea can't be applied directly.",
      "source_hash": 16115701108601332897,
      "context_hash": 2850617837950863291,
      "translation": "같은 아이디어를 그대로 적용할 수는 없습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:01:53.425839Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "Instead we can factor $k$, representing it as $k = k_1^{p_1} \\cdot \\ldots \\cdot k_m^{p_m}$.",
      "source_hash": 4502080168437346583,
      "context_hash": 1359873413455541859,
      "translation": "대신 $k$를 소인수분해하여 $k = k_1^{p_1} \\cdot \\ldots \\cdot k_m^{p_m}$로 나타낼 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:01:53.425839Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:2",
      "source": "For each $k_i$, we find the number of times it is present in $n!$ using the algorithm described above - let's call this value $a_i$.",
      "source_hash": 17497930769231021471,
      "context_hash": 12752941944652756512,
      "translation": "각 $k_i$에 대해 위에서 설명한 알고리즘을 사용하여 $n!$에 $k_i$가 몇 번 포함되는지 구합니다. 이 값을 $a_i$라고 합시다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:01:53.425839Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:3",
      "source": "The answer for composite $k$ will be",
      "source_hash": 11407128967300445060,
      "context_hash": 6603863141903127242,
      "translation": "합성수 $k$에 대한 답은 다음과 같습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:01:53.425839Z",
      "issues": []
    }
  ]
}